spans.s:
अरोग a. free from disease, healthy (also ˚गिन्);
 m.
health.

आरोप m. imposing, laying in or upon;
 substitution of,
identification with (loc.).

आरोपित a. raised, elevated, strung (a bow);
 placed or put
upon, brought to (acc.).

आरोप्य a. to be placed upon;
 to be strung;
 being
substituted or identified.

आरोह॑ m. mounted on (—˚), a rider;
 mounting, rising,
increase, eminence, heap, mountain;
 a woman's hip.

आरो॑हण f. ई a. mounting, ascending;
 n. the same as
subst., also vehicle, carriage, staircase, ladder.
